# A hub and an active client on the internet; a behind a home router on a bad
# link: 75 ms each way (150 ms round trip) with 10 ms of jitter, which reorders,
# and 2% loss each way.
net wan
net home1
node r1  router wan.11 home1.254 nat=home link=delay=75ms/10ms,loss=2%
node hub public wan.20
node w   public wan.30
node a   client home1.10
